    <section class="step step-intro" data-nav="Intro" aria-label="Introduction"><div class="hud"><p>Designing a self-driving car means designing for how people feel about it: whether they trust it, whether they feel safe in it, and whether those feelings hold from one market to the next. We looked at <strong>${e.toLocaleString()} survey responses from 17 countries</strong> to see where they line up and where they don't.</p></div></section>
